--- !u!114 &1337249525
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1337249521}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8957f4fb7f9bb554798bb7a119332b0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Guard
  robber: {fileID: 250524030}
  dialogue: {fileID: 481473225}
  importance: 1
  dialogueLinesCalm:
  - Quiet day so far. Let's hope it stays that way.
  - I've been standing here since seven. My feet stopped hurting around noon. Now
    they're just numb.
  - People think being a guard is all excitement. Mostly, it's standing around and
    watching people walk.
  - You'd be surprised how many people forget where the entrance is.
  - I've worked here for six years. Still don't understand half the buttons on that
    security panel.
  - Nothing interesting ever happens on my shift. That's usually a good thing.
  - You know what's harder than stopping a robbery? Staying awake while waiting for
    one.
  - I've been told I have a very intimidating presence. Personally, I think it's
    the uniform.
  - The bank gives us free coffee. They don't tell you it's the only thing keeping
    us alive.
  - Every morning someone asks me where the bathroom is. I don't know why they think
    I work here.
  - 'Rule number one of security: don''t panic. Rule number two: pretend you know
    rule number one.'
  - I used to think I'd be doing something exciting with my life. Then I got this
    job.
  - My wife says I spend more time with this bank than I do with her. She's probably
    right.
  - My kid thinks I'm a superhero. I haven't had the heart to tell him I mostly check
    doors.
  - I've been saving up for a vacation for three years. Every time I get close, something
    breaks.
  - You ever notice how nobody smiles in a bank? Makes you wonder what they know.
  - I've got twenty years until retirement. I can make it. Probably.
  dialogueLinesAlert:
  - Thanks for the warning, we got this, nobody robbing us this time!
  dialogueLinesHeist:
  - It's dangerous here! Go hide somewhere safe!
